          licensing.
        </li>
        <li>
          Revolv's shutdown notice and the "lifetime subscription" it ended
          are covered by
          <a
            href="https://www.techdirt.com/2016/04/05/you-dont-actually-own-what-you-buy-volume-2203-google-bricking-revolv-smart-home-hardware/"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Techdirt</a
          > and
          <a
            href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/science/revolv-bricked-1.3521927"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">CBC News</a
          >. Insteon's abrupt 2022 shutdown is covered by
          <a
            href="https://hackaday.com/2022/04/25/insteon-abruptly-shuts-down-users-left-smart-home-less/"
